      "prompt": "A boat travels 120 km in 8 hours in total. It goes 20 km/h with the current and 10 km/h against it. Find the time with the current, in hours.",
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "value": 4.0
      },
      "answerText": "4 hours",
      "solution": [
        "Let t be the time with the current. The time against it is 8 − t.",
        "Distance: 20t + 10(8 − t) = 120.",
        "10t + 80 = 120, so t = 4."
      ],
      "langType": "Ch 1 §6 ex. 16",
      "hints": [
